  "recipe": "A shared StrongLifts 5×5 board for a small crew lifting the same program. State holds only the log — one outcome per member per lift for the session in progress, plus finished sessions keyed by date. Working weight, the A/B alternation, miss streaks, the deload and the chart are all derived at render time, because the op language has no arithmetic. Members log 'All reps' or 'Missed' per lift; nobody enters reps or weights by hand, which is a deliberate v0 simplification. The channel host is responsible for saving the session in progress under its date and clearing it, on whatever cadence the crew trains; without that the session in progress grows without end."
}
